  "exportedAt": "2026-07-05T18:30:00.000Z",
  "items": [
    {
      "scope": "text",
      "type": "plan",
      "subtype": "science-pop-video-script",
      "is_active": true,
      "rules_i18n": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "output_format_i18n": {
        "zh": "",
        "en": ""
      },
      "form_options_i18n": null,
      "extra": {
        "display": {
          "taskLabel": "（内部）科普分镜 text 子任务",
          "subtypeLabel": "仅供调试；用户入口请用 Video 页「科普口播剪辑」",
          "userFacing": false,
          "taskLabelI18n": {
            "zh": "（内部）科普分镜 text 子任务",
            "zh-TW": "（內部）科普分鏡 text 子任業務"
          },
          "subtypeLabelI18n": {
            "zh": "仅供调试；用户入口请用 Video 页「科普口播剪辑」",
            "zh-TW": "僅供調重試；使第三方應用者入口請第三方應用 Video 首頁「科普口播剪辑」"
          }
        },
        "taskTemplate": {
          "formSchema": {
            "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "topic",
              "voiceover_audio_url",
              "edit_style",
              "render_plan",
              "aspectRatio"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "topic": {
                "type": "string",
                "title": "科普主题",
                "description": "本期科普视频主题，如「黑巧克力与心血管健康」",
                "minLength": 4,
                "maxLength": 120
              },
              "voiceover_audio_url": {
                "type": "string",
                "title": "口播音频",
                "description": "上传 mp3、从资产库/已完成音频任务选择，或粘贴 URL",
                "x-ui-type": "voiceoverAudio",
                "minLength": 8
              },
              "script": {
                "type": "string",
                "title": "口播稿文本（可选）",
                "description": "若有文稿可粘贴，便于更精准分段与字幕；无则按主题推断",
                "ui:widget": "textarea",
                "ui:options": {
                  "rows": 10
                }
              },
              "audio_duration_seconds": {
                "type": "number",
                "title": "口播时长（秒）",
                "description": "提交后由 ffprobe 自动探测；也可手动修正",
                "minimum": 5,
                "maximum": 1800
              },
              "edit_style": {
                "type": "string",
                "title": "剪辑风格",
                "enum": [
                  "science-minimal",
                  "documentary",
                  "motion-infographic",
                  "classroom"
                ],
                "x-enum-labels": [
                  "极简科普",
                  "纪录片质感",
                  "动感信息图",
                  "课堂白板"
                ],
                "default": "science-minimal"
              },
              "render_plan": {
                "type": "array",
                "title": "剪辑方案",
                "description": "可多选：素材引入（图库/视频库）与 AI 生成。文字动效由 OpenReel overlay 叠加。",
                "minItems": 1,
                "uniqueItems": true,
                "items": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "static-image",
                    "ai-video-gen"
                  ]
                },
                "x-enum-labels": [
                  "素材引入",
                  "AI 生成"
                ],
                "default": [
                  "static-image",
                  "ai-video-gen"
                ]
              },
              "aspectRatio": {
                "type": "string",
                "title": "画幅比例",
                "enum": [
                  "16:9",
                  "9:16",
                  "1:1"
                ],
                "default": "16:9"
              },
              "supplement": {
                "type": "string",
                "title": "补充要求（可选）",
                "description": "重点段落、禁用元素、品牌色等"
              }
            }
          },
          "uiSchema": {
            "script": {
              "ui:widget": "textarea",
              "ui:options": {
                "rows": 10
              }
            },
            "supplement": {
              "ui:widget": "textarea",
              "ui:options": {
                "rows": 3
              }
            }
          },
          "prompt": {
            "unifiedTemplate": "你是 supermxmai **科普视频分镜生成器**。根据口播音频时长与主题，输出 **OpenReel ProjectFile v1.0.0 JSON + mxm* 扩展**，供 VideoTimelineReviewModal 人工审核后自动渲染。\n\n## 输入\n- 主题：${topic}\n- 口播音频 URL：${voiceover_audio_url}\n- **口播总时长（秒，硬约束）**：${audio_duration_seconds}\n- 口播稿（可选）：${script}\n- 句级字幕 JSON（前置 ASR/TTS，可选）：${voiceover_subtitles_json}\n- 剪辑风格：${edit_style}（science-minimal=深色极简科普 / documentary=纪实镜头感 / motion-infographic=数据信息图 / classroom=白板教学）\n- 画面生成方案：${render_plan}\n- 画幅：${aspectRatio}\n- 补充：${supplement}\n\n## 时长硬约束（最重要）\n1. `project.timeline.duration` **必须等于** ${audio_duration_seconds} 秒（误差 ≤0.5s）\n2. 所有可视片段 `startTime`+`duration` 连续铺满 0～总时长，**不得留黑场**\n3. audio track 主轨 `clip-audio-main`：`mediaId` 使用 `tts:${voiceover_audio_url}`，`duration`=${audio_duration_seconds}，`startTime`=0\n4. `timeline.subtitles`：若 voiceover_subtitles_json 非空，解析其 segments（text/startSeconds/endSeconds）逐句生成字幕与时间轴；否则按口播节奏估算（中文约 4 字/秒）\n5. 每个可视片段的 mxmPrompt / 配图语义须对齐对应时段口播内容（优先按句级字幕分段）\n\n## 输出格式\n- version=\"1.0.0\"；5 种 Track 按需；**每个可视 clip.metadata.mxmRenderMode 必填**\n- 三种模式：`ai-video-gen` | `static-image` | `gsap-html-animation`\n- ai-video-gen：video track，`mxmPrompt` 英文，`mxmVideoMode=text-to-video`\n- static-image：video track，`mxmSourceImageUrl` 可留空（审核 UI 选图），`mxmPrompt` 写英文配图/运镜描述\n- gsap-html-animation：graphics track，必填 `mxmHtmlContent`+`mxmGsapTimeline`，风格对齐 ${edit_style}\n\n## render_plan 分配策略（严格遵守）\n\n### gsap-only\n- **全部**可视段使用 `gsap-html-animation`（graphics track）\n- 开场标题卡 5～8s + 正文信息卡/图表段 + 收尾 4～6s\n\n### static-image-only\n- **全部**可视段使用 `static-image`（video track）\n- 每段 `mxmPrompt` 描述 Ken Burns 推拉/轻动效；`mxmSourceImageUrl` 留空字符串\n\n### ai-only\n- **全部**可视段使用 `ai-video-gen`（video track）\n- 科普场景、实验演示、微观世界等用英文 cinematic prompt\n\n### hybrid-balanced（推荐科普）\n- 开场 5～8s：`gsap-html-animation` 标题卡\n- 概念解释段：`static-image`（配图+推拉，每段 8～15s）\n- 动态演示/场景叙事：`ai-video-gen`（每段 6～12s，控制总量 ≤40% 时长）\n- 数据/对比/要点：`gsap-html-animation` 信息卡\n- 收尾 4～6s：`gsap-html-animation`\n\n## 科普分段建议\n- 按语义断句，每段 6～15 秒\n- 抽象概念 → static-image 或 gsap；具体现象/实验 → ai-video-gen\n- markers 标注章节切换点\n\n## 约束\n1. **只输出合法 JSON**，无 markdown 包裹\n2. mxm* 字段带前缀\n3. 字幕与口播稿对齐\n4. 全片时长必须匹配口播\n\n为本期【${topic}】生成完整 ProjectFile JSON。"
          },
          "extra": {
            "generateParams": {
              "temperature": 0.35,
              "topP": 0.9,
              "maxTokens": 20000
            }
          },
          "pipeline": {
            "pre": [
              {
                "step": "resolveVoiceoverAudio",
                "params": {
                  "audioUrlFrom": "${params.voiceover_audio_url}",
                  "durationField": "audio_duration_seconds"
                }
              },
              {
                "step": "transcribeVoiceoverAudio",
                "params": {
                  "audioUrlFrom": "${params.voiceover_audio_url}",
                  "skipWhenTtsSubtitles": true,
                  "skipWhenScriptPresent": true,
                  "language": "zh"
                }
              }
            ],
            "post": [
              {
                "step": "manualReview",
                "params": {
                  "id": "science-pop-video-review",
                  "label": "科普视频分镜审核（时间轴）",
                  "hint": "调整分镜：切换画面类型、选择素材或 AI 生成内容，可剪切合并；通过后逐段渲染（不含文字动效/转场）。",
                  "kind": "video-timeline",
                  "timelinePhase": "plan",
                  "draftFrom": "${state.finalArtifact.text}",
                  "applyMapping": {
                    "state.videoEditScriptJson": "${review.json}",
                    "state.videoEditScriptMetadata": "${review.metadata}"
                  },
                  "editable": true
                }
              },
              {
                "step": "videoTimelineRender",
                "params": {
                  "renderOptions": {
                    "concatFinal": false,
                    "applyOverlays": false,
                    "applySubtitleBurn": false
                  },
                  "inputMapping": {
                    "videoEditScriptJson": "${state.videoEditScriptJson}",
                    "label": "${params.topic}"
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "step": "manualReview",
                "params": {
                  "id": "science-pop-render-review",
                  "label": "科普视频成片审核（时间轴）",
                  "hint": "各段已生成。在此精修转场、文字叠加与动效；确认后导出完整成片。",
                  "kind": "video-timeline",
                  "timelinePhase": "rendered",
                  "draftFrom": "${state.videoEditScriptJson}",
                  "applyMapping": {
                    "state.videoEditScriptJson": "${review.json}"
                  },
                  "editable": true
                }
              },
              {
                "step": "videoTimelineRender",
                "params": {
                  "renderOptions": {
                    "concatFinal": true,
                    "skipReadyClips": true,
                    "applySubtitleBurn": true,
                    "applyOverlays": true,
                    "applyTransitions": true
                  },
                  "inputMapping": {
                    "videoEditScriptJson": "${state.videoEditScriptJson}",
                    "label": "${params.topic}"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "storage": {
            "scope": "text",
            "extension": "json",
            "mime": "application/json",
            "bucket": "user-media",
            "pathTemplate": "{userId}/science-pop-video/{timestamp}-{randomId}/",
            "filenameTemplate": "science_pop_{taskId}_{randomId}.json"
          }
        }
      },
      "routing": {
        "logical_model": "text-plan-science-pop-video-script",
        "provider": "maxplan",
        "model": "MiniMax-M3",
        "enabled": true,
        "sensitive_word_lists": []
      },
      "businessPricing": [
        {
          "business_type": "text-plan-science-pop-video-script",
          "charge_metric": "per_request",
          "price_in_tokens": 120,
          "min_charge_tokens": 0,
          "provider": "maxplan",
          "model_key": "MiniMax-M3",
          "subtype": "science-pop-video-script",
          "metadata": {
            "margin": 0.25
          }
        }
      ],
      "linkedTextFormat": null
    }
  ]
}
